###################################################
#                                                 #
# B- -> Lambda pbar   +cc                         #
#                                                 #
# Author: Aaron Roodman                           #
# created:                    26/Aug/02           #
###################################################
#
# Decay table for B- -> pi- pi0 using a simple PHSP
# model.
#
Alias MyB+ B+
Alias MyB- B-
Alias MyLambda0 Lambda0
Alias Myanti-Lambda0 anti-Lambda0
Alias MyLc Lambda_c+
Alias Myanti-Lc anti-Lambda_c-
Alias MyK_S0  K_S0

#
Decay Upsilon(4S)
0.5000 MyB+ B-              VSS;
0.5000 MyB- B+              VSS;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyB-
1.00     Myanti-Lambda0  Myanti-Lc    PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyB+
1.00     MyLambda0  MyLc    PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyLambda0
1.00 p+ pi-                  PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay Myanti-Lambda0
1.00 anti-p- pi+             PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyLc
0.25         p+      K-      pi+     PHSP;
0.25         p+      MyK_S0          PHSP;
0.25         p+      MyK_S0  pi+ pi- PHSP;
0.25         MyLambda0      pi- pi+ pi+    PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay Myanti-Lc
0.25         anti-p-      K+      pi-     PHSP;
0.25         anti-p-      MyK_S0          PHSP;
0.25         anti-p-      MyK_S0  pi- pi+ PHSP;
0.25         Myanti-Lambda0      pi+ pi- pi-    PHSP;
Enddecay
#
Decay MyK_S0
1.0000  pi+ pi-                   PHSP;
Enddecay
#
End
